{
  "slug": "protect-mcp",
  "name": "Protect Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP security gateway that wraps any MCP server with per-tool policies, Ed25519-signed decision receipts, and human approval gates. Shadow mode (default) logs every tool call without blocking. Enforce mode applies per-tool allow/deny/rate-limit/approval policies. Every decision is cryptographically signed and independently verifiable offline. MIT licensed. IETF Internet-Draft published for the receipts protocol.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `enforce` (Wrap an MCP server with per-tool security policies), `red-team` (Run attack suites against MCP security policies to verify they block what they should), `shadow` (Wrap an MCP server in shadow mode to log all tool calls without blocking), `verify` (Verify Ed25519-signed decision receipts offline)\n- **Commands** (2): `shadow`, `verify`\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install protect-mcp@claude-community` from `tomjwxf/protect-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 2
  },
